  "body": "Unicode symbol with id 9608 cannot be posted to description or comment and results in crash:\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/aru8ygh15hwh8v3/%D0%97%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BA%20%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%202015-09-03%2017.53.27.png?dl=0\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. python3.4 -c \"print (chr(9608))\"\n2. copy/paste\n3. observe screen as above\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-471)\n\n(Reported by Bohdan Turkynewych)",
